THE GATHERING.

SYRIAN FORCES HAVE DEVASTATED 2 PLTS FROM INDIA CO/12TH
CAV IN THE SOUTH EASTERN AREA OF OPERATIONS DESIGNATED 
SECTOR ZULU-MIKE ONE. 

ECHO-1'S ORDERS ARE TO PROCEED ALONG AN EASTWARD COURSE HEADING
TO PRIMARY TARGET ZONE. ECHO-1 IS TO DESTROY THE SOVIET BUILT 
SIGNALS INTELLIGENCE/ELECTRONICS WARFARE EMPLACEMENT. THESE TARGETS 
ARE TO INCLUDE ANY AND ALL COMSAT ARRAY DISHES AND ACCOMPANYING 
RELAY BUNKERS. FURTHERMORE, ALL DUG IN ENEMY UNITS ARE SANCTIONED. 

ECHO-2 ON LINE TO ASSIST.


